cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use ZaroPGx, please cite it as below, and cite the tools and data it
  is built on: docs/user/credits.md lists them, and each report lists the ones
  its run used.
title: ZaroPGx
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Yaroshevskiy
    given-names: Iliya
version: 0.4.1
date-released: 2026-10-25
license: AGPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/Zaromics/ZaroPGx"
abstract: >-
  A self-hosted pharmacogenomics pipeline: it runs PharmCAT, PyPGx, OptiType and
  mtDNA-Server 2 on a person's sequencing data and writes PDF, HTML, interactive
  and FHIR reports.
keywords:
  - pharmacogenomics
  - PharmCAT
  - PyPGx
  - star alleles
  - HLA typing
  - mitochondrial DNA
references:
